# Settling an item twice charges once, enforced by a DATABASE key (one charge per job item), not only by the idempotency key the store derives. The fault drops the unique index; a second charge for the same item under a different idempotency key is then ALLOWED.
GATE=settle-once
TARGET=platform
SETUP=
STEP=go test TestMoneySchema_OneChargePerItem (database integration test, real Postgres)
CMD=H_PG_ADMIN_DSN="$FAULT_ADMIN_DSN" bash tests/harness/run-db-tests.sh '^TestMoneySchema_OneChargePerItem$'
MESSAGE=--- FAIL: TestMoneySchema_OneChargePerItem
